    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：殷舒 小韩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 巍山古城：南诏故国，安静、原始、性价比高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">05:33</a> 远离游客扎堆的喧嚣，一天三顿除了吃就是发呆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">06:11</a> 气候温润，房租低廉，适合长期停留</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 漫步古城：在百年茶馆看老人们下棋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 吃在巍山：一根面、饵丝饵块、菌子Omakase</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 探访巍宝山：长春洞藻井是必看项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">27:57</a> 古老书院的重生：荒废学府变身最有活力书店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">31:33</a> 骑鲸天上：巍山独有的挽联文化</span></p><span></span><p><span>附：韩主播关于巍山挽联文化的帖子：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="http://xhslink.com/m/vM2y2sbkGQ" data-url="http://xhslink.com/m/vM2y2sbkGQ"><span>xhslink.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>同步上线：苹果播客 小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎评论区留言，与两位主播互动</span></p>]]></description>
