    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：殷舒 小韩</span></p><span></span><p><span>乙巳蛇年春节前夕，两位主播来到天津游玩，本期节目记录当地的春节气氛。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBybrzAbpnY-GgY2qOi74v5nxg-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 天津年味部分来源于偷偷放鞭炮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 新晋“8A级景点”跳水大爷：“生存一分钟，快乐60秒”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 冻牢的海河成了“冰上游乐场”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 从北安桥和亚历山大三世桥聊起：谁还分得清“天津”和“巴黎”啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 在马可波罗广场找厕所：天津文旅扣大分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 天津解放北路银行街 VS 上海外滩万国建筑群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 天津年轻人的“夜场活动”：半夜排煎饼果子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 天津肉类美食甜度震惊上海人</span></p><span></span><p><span>加群通道：shenduwanjia021</span></p><span></span><p><span>同步上线：苹果播客 小宇宙 喜马拉雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎评论区留言，与两位主播互动</span></p>]]></description>
