  <item>
    <title>EP.52 自从去过泉州，我开始相信神明了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6777d41515a5fd520ecd088e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6777d41515a5fd520ecd088e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Jan 2025 12:20:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：殷舒 小韩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> 半城烟火半城仙，泉州不愧“众神人间办事处”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 和谐共融：佛教、道教、伊斯兰教、印度教、基督教、摩尼教</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> “自从去过泉州，我变得迷信神明了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 烟火鼎盛关岳庙：投掷圣杯求签小攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1104">18:24</a> 一碗泉州牛排，串联千年海上丝绸之路两端</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 开元寺：东西双塔、插上天使翅膀的中国飞天、孙悟空的原型“猴行者”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">26:12</a> 在泉州的老巷子里，藏着满城的惊喜与烟火气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2099">34:59</a> 泉州名吃补遗：秉正堂四果汤、斯丹姜母鸭、海丝金凤花生元宵、水门国仔面线糊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a> 闽南粽子：就差把“豪华”二字写在粽叶上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2717">45:17</a> 蚵仔煎，沿海古厝孕育的漳州美食</span></p><span></span><p><span>加群通道：shenduwanjia021</span></p><span></span><p><span>同步上线：苹果播客 小宇宙 喜马拉雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎评论区留言，与两位主播互动</span></p>]]></description>
