  <item>
    <title>EP.48 古巴社会主义一线观察：食品仍实行配给制</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670d53180d2f24f2891b2b3d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670d53180d2f24f2891b2b3d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：殷舒 小韩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 越南、俄罗斯、古巴、朝鲜，殷主播开启社会主义国家之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 古巴之旅万事俱备：免签、直航、货币统一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 古巴初印象：设施确实破旧，但治安令人放心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 哈瓦那掠影：卡斯特罗、切格瓦拉、何塞马蒂的城市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1213">20:13</a> 社会主义遗存：当地吃喝仍然实行配给制，每月鸡蛋限量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 伴随配给制，黑市是必然产物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1739">28:59</a> 古巴贫富差很小，牙医收入没比老百姓高多少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> 古巴国父何塞马蒂雕像手指美国领事馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 除哈瓦那外，古巴基本没有西方白人游客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 去古巴旅行会影响办理美国签证吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>加群通道：shenduwanjia021</span></p><span></span><p><span>同步上线：苹果播客 小宇宙 喜马拉雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎评论区留言，与两位主播互动</span></p>]]></description>
