  <item>
    <title>EP.47 延迟退休来了，受伤最深的可能是女工人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e9046e5ca6d0ace36bdeaa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e9046e5ca6d0ace36bdeaa</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Sep 2024 04:24:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：殷舒 小韩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 人到中年听到消息的第一感受：绝望至极</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 政策复盘：男职工从60岁延迟到63岁，女职工从50岁、55岁分别延迟到55岁、58岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 面对缴费年限提高，已经规划好退休生活的“躺平博主”们措手不及</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> 年龄不在过渡期表格内的群体：很担心到自己退休时年龄又要持续累加</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> “坚持自愿、弹性是这次改革的重要原则”，是什么意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 男职工、女工人、女干部，受伤最深的可能是女工人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 苦中作乐，延迟退休段子盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 新加坡养老金规模令人印象深刻，人少但钱多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> “新规只是说到60岁还要上班，但不一定还有工作。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> 未来中国会有更多为长者量身定制的工作岗位吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>加群通道：shenduwanjia021</span></p><span></span><p><span>同步上线：苹果播客 小宇宙 喜马拉雅</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎评论区留言，与两位主播互动</span></p>]]></description>
